  "header": {
    "subsystemType": "Hrot.Scenario",
    "schemaVersion": "1.0",
    "terrainName": "test-town",
    "description": "What: LLM commander (L-1 CE-4676, L-2 CE-4679; DESIGN_LLM_Commander §1) - a body-less Platoon (TKB 305) whose brain is a SEAT (CommanderSeat, Mind Scripted: no own play, InertSop) over Alpha Squad and Bravo Squad (4 men each), starting behind the L-Block (300,140) on test-town, out of Red's sight; Red's Defenders (5 men, SquadDefend + BasicSquadSop, the full game AI) hold the sheds ('house', 64,108). Named points: house, objective (172,95) and support (160,96) behind the Low Wall, start (300,140); six 1.5 m walls ('Cover 1-6') stagger the lane to the house. The scripted mind sends both squads to the objective; on the first SPOT the squad nearest the enemy attacks the reported place and the other supports by fire from 'support'. Judge: (1) a squad is attacking within 1 s of sim time of the first SPOT/CONTACT into the platoon; (2) the platoon's own play never runs (no PlatoonHold, no ReactToFireFromBuilding); (3) each squad fights with its own AI and reports at least once to the platoon; (4) the squads stay in contact at least 60 s (Red and Blue both still fire a minute after Red's first shot). Fail: no order after the spot, an order from the platoon's own SOP, a squad that never reports, a fight over within a minute. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh llm-platoon-attack"
  },
